---
---

<section class="about-section section-padding" id="about" aria-label="About Philosophy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-header">
      <h2 class="about-statement">
        I design and build digital products for <span class="text-highlight">web and mobile</span>.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-narrative">
        <p class="narrative-lead">
          I partner with founders and engineering teams to turn ideas into working software — handling architecture, interface design, and full-stack development.
        </p>
        <p class="narrative-body">
          I design and engineer products from first prototype to production. Instead of over-complicated systems, I focus on delivering clean code, fast page loads, and intuitive user flows that solve real problems.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-pillars">
        <div class="pillar-item">
          <span class="pillar-index">01</span>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h3 class="pillar-title">Speed & Reliability</h3>
            <p class="pillar-desc">Fast load times, responsive interfaces, and stable architecture across devices.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
          <span class="pillar-index">02</span>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h3 class="pillar-title">End-to-End Execution</h3>
            <p class="pillar-desc">From initial prototyping and database design to testing, deployment, and cloud setup.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
          <span class="pillar-index">03</span>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h3 class="pillar-title">Design & UX Detail</h3>
            <p class="pillar-desc">Clear typography, cohesive design systems, and straightforward user flows.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(6, 7, 9, 0.4) 0%, rgba(6, 7, 9, 0.95) 12%, var(--bg) 25%, var(--bg) 100%);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .about-header {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .about-statement {
    font-size: var(--text-title-1);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .text-highlight {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 7rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-narrative {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .narrative-lead {
    font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .narrative-body {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pillar-index {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .pillar-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
